{"id":"93e91e78693d2a69","group":"72","path":"72/72-lem-bounded-function-occurrence-elimination.md","title":"有界函数图的两种消去形式","display":"lem-bounded-function-occurrence-elimination — 有界函数图的两种消去形式","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-lem-bounded-function-occurrence-elimination","aliases":["72-lem-bounded-function-occurrence-elimination"],"display":"lem-bounded-function-occurrence-elimination — 有界函数图的两种消去形式","depends_on":["[[72-df-bounded-unique-arithmetic-graph]]","[[72-df-unique-function-definition-extension]]"],"chapter":"II","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.II Theorem1.2.7.3 proof, print88/PDF100; two explicitly displayed elimination formulas","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-lem-bounded-function-occurrence-elimination"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-lem-bounded-function-occurrence-elimination</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-bounded-function-occurrence-elimination — 有界函数图的两种消去形式"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"34a6558383e94659\" href=\"?note=34a6558383e94659\" title=\"72-df-bounded-unique-arithmetic-graph\">72-df-bounded-unique-arithmetic-graph</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"359d2fc3caebbb0d\" href=\"?note=359d2fc3caebbb0d\" title=\"72-df-unique-function-definition-extension\">72-df-unique-function-definition-extension</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"II"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.II Theorem1.2.7.3 proof, print88/PDF100; two explicitly displayed elimination formulas"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BUG}_T(\\rho,\\vec x,y,b)\">\\(\\operatorname{BUG}_T(\\rho,\\vec x,y,b)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T[f:\\rho]\">\\(T[f:\\rho]\\)</span> 为相应定义扩充。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 为旧语言公式，u是待替换变量；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec t\">\\(\\vec t\\)</span> 为旧语言项表，长度等于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x\">\\(\\vec x\\)</span>。取新鲜 z，不在 A、ρ、b、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec t\">\\(\\vec t\\)</span> 的全部出现变量及 u、y、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x\">\\(\\vec x\\)</span> 中；所有代入同时且避免捕获。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho(\\vec t,z)\">\\(\\rho(\\vec t,z)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b(\\vec t)\">\\(b(\\vec t)\\)</span> 是在原模板中分别以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec t,z\">\\(\\vec t,z\\)</span> 替换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x,y\">\\(\\vec x,y\\)</span> 的语法记号；自由参数在下式全称闭包。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T[f:\\rho]\\vdash_{\\mathcal L_f}\\operatorname{ucl}_{\\mathcal L_f}\n\\bigl(A[f(\\vec t)/u]\\leftrightarrow\\exists z\\le b(\\vec t)\\ (\\rho(\\vec t,z)\\land A[z/u])\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T[f:\\rho]\\vdash_{\\mathcal L_f}\\operatorname{ucl}_{\\mathcal L_f}\n\\bigl(A[f(\\vec t)/u]\\leftrightarrow\\exists z\\le b(\\vec t)\\ (\\rho(\\vec t,z)\\land A[z/u])\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T[f:\\rho]\\vdash_{\\mathcal L_f}\\operatorname{ucl}_{\\mathcal L_f}\n\\bigl(A[f(\\vec t)/u]\\leftrightarrow\\forall z\\le b(\\vec t)\\ (\\rho(\\vec t,z)\\to A[z/u])\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T[f:\\rho]\\vdash_{\\mathcal L_f}\\operatorname{ucl}_{\\mathcal L_f}\n\\bigl(A[f(\\vec t)/u]\\leftrightarrow\\forall z\\le b(\\vec t)\\ (\\rho(\\vec t,z)\\to A[z/u])\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>定义公理使所有图见证都等于 f(t⃗)，且 BUG 给界内至少一个见证。用等式替换得到存在式和全称式两个方向。新鲜性防止输入项或 A 的参数被新量词捕获。A 为有界公式时，这两个表达仍有界；一般递归消去还要处理函数位于量词界中的情况，不能从这一单次替换引理直接声称全部层级保持已证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-bounded-unique-arithmetic-graph","status":"resolved","id":"34a6558383e94659","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-bounded-unique-arithmetic-graph]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-unique-function-definition-extension","status":"resolved","id":"359d2fc3caebbb0d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-unique-function-definition-extension]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{BUG}_T(\\rho,\\vec x,y,b)","display":false},{"tex":"T[f:\\rho]","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec t","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec x","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec t","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec x","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho(\\vec t,z)","display":false},{"tex":"b(\\vec t)","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec t,z","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec x,y","display":false},{"tex":"T[f:\\rho]\\vdash_{\\mathcal L_f}\\operatorname{ucl}_{\\mathcal L_f}\n\\bigl(A[f(\\vec t)/u]\\leftrightarrow\\exists z\\le b(\\vec t)\\ (\\rho(\\vec t,z)\\land A[z/u])\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"T[f:\\rho]\\vdash_{\\mathcal L_f}\\operatorname{ucl}_{\\mathcal L_f}\n\\bigl(A[f(\\vec t)/u]\\leftrightarrow\\forall z\\le b(\\vec t)\\ (\\rho(\\vec t,z)\\to A[z/u])\\bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":2132,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-30","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"II章新增9项：[[72-df-bounded-unique-arithmetic-graph]] · [[72-df-division-remainder-graphs]] · [[72-df-truncated-subtraction-graph]] · [[72-df-unique-function-definition-extension]] · [[72-lem-bounded-function-occurrence-elimination]] · [[72-thm-i-delta-zero-division]] · [[72-thm-i-delta-zero-minimization]] · [[72-thm-i-delta-zero-subtraction]] · [[72-thm-unique-function-definition-conservative]]"},{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-26","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"II章新增9项：[[72-df-bounded-unique-arithmetic-graph]] · [[72-df-division-remainder-graphs]] · [[72-df-truncated-subtraction-graph]] · [[72-df-unique-function-definition-extension]] · [[72-lem-bounded-function-occurrence-elimination]] · [[72-thm-i-delta-zero-division]] · [[72-thm-i-delta-zero-minimization]] · [[72-thm-i-delta-zero-subtraction]] · [[72-thm-unique-function-definition-conservative]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-24","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"II章新增9项：[[72-df-bounded-unique-arithmetic-graph]] · [[72-df-division-remainder-graphs]] · [[72-df-truncated-subtraction-graph]] · [[72-df-unique-function-definition-extension]] · [[72-lem-bounded-function-occurrence-elimination]] · [[72-thm-i-delta-zero-division]] · [[72-thm-i-delta-zero-minimization]] · [[72-thm-i-delta-zero-subtraction]] · [[72-thm-unique-function-definition-conservative]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-26","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"II章新增9项：[[72-df-bounded-unique-arithmetic-graph]] 